@host = http://localhost:18083

### GET: path / now / random / seq
GET {{host}}/mock/api/coil/C001

### POST: first 202, then 200 (last response holds)
POST {{host}}/mock/api/coil/C001/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"STOPPED"}

### Deterministic 503 for DTCore retry testing
GET {{host}}/mock/api/unstable

### Recent requests (newest first)
GET {{host}}/mock-admin/requests?limit=10

### Routes
GET {{host}}/mock-admin/routes

### One route
GET {{host}}/mock-admin/routes/coil-get

### Create a sequence: 503 then 200, repeated in a cycle
POST {{host}}/mock-admin/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "retry-demo",
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/api/retry/{id}",
  "body": "{\"id\":\"{{path.id}}\",\"seq\":{{seq}},\"label\":\"{{query.label}}\"}",
  "delayMinMs": 5,
  "delayMaxMs": 10,
  "responses": [{"status":503}, {"status":200}],
  "cycle": true,
  "enabled": true
}

### Call twice to observe 503 -> 200
GET {{host}}/mock/api/retry/C001?label=hello
X-Name: tester

### Replace the complete route
PUT {{host}}/mock-admin/routes/retry-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "retry-demo",
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/api/retry/{id}",
  "status": 200,
  "body": "{\"id\":\"{{path.id}}\",\"status\":\"recovered\"}"
}

### Explicit enable/disable
PATCH {{host}}/mock-admin/routes/retry-demo/enabled
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### Toggle enabled
POST {{host}}/mock-admin/routes/retry-demo/toggle

### Import UE DataTable JSON export; existing ids are skipped
POST {{host}}/mock-admin/import/dtcore-api-table
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"Name":"GetCoil","ApiMethod":"EApiMethod::Get","ApiUrl":"/api/coil/{coilId}","ApiResource":"Coil","ApiAction":"Get"},
  {"Name":"SetStatus","ApiMethod":"POST","ApiUrl":"/api/coil/{coilId}/status"}
]

### Import with overwrite
POST {{host}}/mock-admin/import/dtcore-api-table?overwrite=true
Content-Type: application/json

[{"Name":"GetCoil","ApiMethod":"GET","ApiUrl":"/api/coil/{coilId}"}]

### Delete a route
DELETE {{host}}/mock-admin/routes/retry-demo

### Reload all definitions from routes-dir (discards in-memory edits)
POST {{host}}/mock-admin/routes/reload

### Clear request journal
DELETE {{host}}/mock-admin/requests
